  "task": "Fix build_query in query.py so list-valued parameters become repeated key/value pairs, spaces use form URL encoding, and empty lists emit no pairs. Read the official documentation at https://docs.python.org/3/library/urllib.parse.html first and identify the relevant urlencode option. Use the standard library and make the smallest repair. Keep one implementation milestone covering the repair and its verification. Both baseline and acceptance command are: python3 test_query.py . Do not edit test_query.py. You may edit this isolated fixture and run its checks. In your final answer name the documented option you used and cite the official source. Do not install dependencies or create unrelated files.",
  "initial_source": "from urllib.parse import urlencode\n\ndef build_query(params):\n    return urlencode(params)\n",
